{#
	About page (GLOSSARY: the collective's identity page).

	The biography is two rich-text fields, one per language: the Spanish bio is
	always present, the English bio is optional. The divider between them is
	drawn here by the shared `divider` macro, never stored in the content.
	`team` stays one rich-text field so editors keep free-form control over
	names, roles and the former-collaborators heading.
#}
{%- from "partials/divider.njk" import divider -%}
<article class="about">
	<div class="about-main">
		<div class="about-bio">{{ bio_es | md | safe }}{% if bio_en and bio_en | trim %}{{ divider() }}
{{ bio_en | md | safe }}{% endif %}</div>
		<div class="about-team">{{ team | md | safe }}</div>
	</div>
</article>
